Author: LiuShiyuMath <liusy@nb-ai.com>
Date:   Sat May 9 01:34:10 2026 +0800

    docs(m6): rewire CLI help + sync release README (issue 174 #1, #7)
    
    Three help/onboarding-text changes:
    
    1. teamagent try is now the headline 30-sec entry in --help and README
       (per P1 probe CHOICE: A). teamagent demo hook is demoted to
       [advanced] with a help line that documents the new multi-field
       syntax (issue 174 #4): space, ;, & or JSON form.
    
    2. doctor --fix help rewritten from the circular line
       "自动修复能自动修的问题" to a 5-line concrete enumeration:
       - 旧版 TEAMAGENT:START 生成块（剥离）
       - hook 注册路径过期（更新指向当前安装）
       - skill 文件残留（清理）
       plus a mention of the ~/.teamagent/backups/ safety net and
       --dry-run preview.
    
    3. Release branch README sync: .github/workflows/release-branch.yml
       now copies README.md into /tmp/release-stage so visiting
       github.com/libz-renlab-ai/TeamBrain/tree/release no longer 404s
       on the readme card. Existing copy lines (dist/, package.json,
       postinstall.mjs, install.sh, release-meta.json) unchanged.
    
    README.md L57 updated to recommend `teamagent try` (replacing the
    older `teamagent demo` headline) consistent with the --help reorder.
    
    Project-gate 1+2+3 hard-match in judge.md targets the new
    `teamagent try --help` and `teamagent demo hook --help` surfaces.
    
